---
title: Cody's Avocado Toast
author: Cody Swithenbank
cook time: 15 minutes
servings: 1 Servings
course: Breakfast
cuisine: American
tags: tofu, vegan, breakfast
prep time: 15 minutes
---

Cut and crosshatch @avocado{whole} and remove into a bowl. Mix with the juice of half a @lime{1/2}, @salt{to taste}, @pepper{to taste}, @red pepper flakes{0.5 tsp} and optional but highly recommended @./Tofu Bacon Bits{2 tbsp}.

Toast @bread{2 medium slices} and cut @cherry tomatoes{generous handful} in halves.

Assemble the toast, place avocado mix on top of the toast, followed by arranging the cherry tomatoes.

Top with @olive oil{1 tbsp} and @everything seasoning{1 tsp}. Enjoy